# The release workflow updates `version` and `date-released` on each release.
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software or the composites it produced, cite them as below.
type: software
title: "Landsat LST P95 composites (2021-2025)"
abstract: >-
  Processing code and metadata for scene-normalized 95th-percentile land
  surface temperature composites from Landsat 8 and 9 observations, 2021 to
  2025, published as cloud-optimized GeoTIFFs in a Portolan catalog on Source
  Cooperative.
